  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> is a root of the quadratic equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6LYYt",
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>–</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
